  "title": "PepGen Announces Topline Results from Lowest Dose (5 mg/kg) MAD Cohort in the Ongoing Phase 2 FREEDOM2 Study Demonstrating Favorable Safety, Splicing and vHOT Data",
  "summary": "– PGN-EDODM1 was generally well-tolerated with all adverse events mild or moderate and no serious adverse events reported – – Mean splicing correction of 7.3% observed with PGN-EDODM1 (n=6) versus 6.8% with placebo (n=2); Excluding one outlier patient, treatment group demonstrated mean splicing",
